  data: {
    LLM: "After the deal, there is a betting round. Then each player in turn may discard any number of cards and receive that many replacements from the deck. A second betting round follows, then showdown. Each hand is the player's four cards plus the community card; the table card and all cards of its rank are wild. Highest hand wins.",
    Player: "After the deal, there is a betting round. Then each player in turn may discard any number of cards and receive that many replacements from the deck. A second betting round follows, then showdown. Each hand is the player's four cards plus the community card; the table card and all cards of its rank are wild. Highest hand wins.",
    objective: 'Win the pot by having the highest five-card poker hand at showdown, using your four private cards plus the single community card (with wilds).',
    gameplay: "After the deal, there is a betting round. Then each player in turn may discard any number of cards and receive that many replacements from the deck. A second betting round follows, then showdown. Each hand is the player's four cards plus the community card; the table card and all cards of its rank are wild. Highest hand wins.",
    keyRules: [
      'Four cards per player plus one face-up community card; that card and all of same rank are wild.',
      'One betting round after the deal, then a draw round (discard and replace), then a second betting round, then showdown.',
      'Best five-card hand using four hole cards plus the community card wins the pot.',
    ],
